<h1><span data-field="title" data-format="default">path_end</span></h1>
<p>This function ends the current path that the instance is following, as set when the function <span class="inline3_func"><a href="path_start.htm">path_start</a></span> was called.</p>
<div data-conref="../../../../assets/snippets/Note_Call_From_Instance_Scope.hts">
<p class="note"><span data-conref="../../../../assets/snippets/Tag_warning.hts"><span class="warning">WARNING</span></span> This function should be called from the scope of an instance. An error will be thrown if it&#39;s not.</p>
</div>
<p> </p>
<h4>Syntax:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-field="title" data-format="default">path_end</span>();</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Returns:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-keyref="Type_Void">N/A</span></p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p> </p>
<p class="code">if (place_meeting(x, y, obj_Blocker)) <br/>
{<br/>
    <span data-field="title" data-format="default">path_end</span>();<br/>
}</p>
<p>The above code will end the current path if the instance detects any collision with any instance of the given object.</p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
